# Keep secrets, local data and build output out of the image build context.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.data
infra/production/secrets
infra/production/backups
apps/web/e2e/.auth
apps/web/test-results
apps/web/playwright-report
qa-results
.git
infra/production/exports
